%N A383890 Index of record gaps between totient numbers.
%C A383890 Values of k such that A002202(k+1) - A002202(k) > A002202(i+1) - A002202(i) for all i<k. The gaps are in A383889.
%e A383890 A002202(8) - A002202(7) = 4, which is greater than A002202(i+1) - A002202(i) for all i<7, so 7 is in the sequence.
%o A383890 (PARI) my(m=0); [n-1 | n<-[2..#A2202], m < m=max(m, A2202[n]-A2202[n-1])] \\ where A2202 should be a vector with sufficiently many terms of A002202. - _M. F. Hasler_, Sep 29 2026
